{"script":"sj_019_03","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1b","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":100,"y":-423.20000000000005,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara019_1","scaleY":0.9},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1b","transTime":300,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":100,"y":-423.20000000000005,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara019_1","scaleY":0.9},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我想为软软搭个属于它自己的窝！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]软软特别喜欢木头制作的屋子，不像石头和泥土冰冰凉凉的，木头啊皮草之类的地板能让软软觉得安心。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我想借用一点空间，给软软做个睡起来舒服的小窝，可以吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]咦，你问会不会不小心把它点燃？软软才不会这么做呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]咦，你是说她身上的火焰吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]那个呀，其实也是她身体的一部分。只是看起来像火焰，其实并没有太高的温度唷。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]毕竟元素生物的本质，就是涌流在世界中的元素嘛。当然，这都是大书院里的知识！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯？{myName}也要帮忙制作软软的小窝？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯，当然好呀……！有工匠帮忙，肯定会顺利很多！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]谢谢你，{myName}！软软肯定会很高兴的！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"奇瓦-这些木板是？"}